WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:02.630
The seedlings sprout in seedbeds.

2
00:00:03.130 --> 00:00:06.850
Then young seedlings move into individual bags to develop.

3
00:00:06.850 --> 00:00:11.190
They stay for six to seven months before farm planting.

4
00:00:12.130 --> 00:00:17.550
After planting, trees need three to four years for their first meaningful harvest.

5
00:00:18.210 --> 00:00:22.590
Trees bloom with white flowers that only lasts a few days.

6
00:00:23.610 --> 00:00:26.930
Take a quick guess by clicking the button in front of you.
